{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552440/extras/7815667b4f5b10384515050060d4cf28.apng?t=1772689940\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552440/extras/7815667b4f5b10384515050060d4cf28.poster.avif?t=1772689940\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=71 /></picture></span><strong>\u300aTwo: Solar Home\u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0is a local co-op platformer game for <i>two players</i>, featuring impressive <i>pixel art</i> and handcrafted levels. Players take on the roles of a brother and sister exploring the collapsed solar system and the silent, deserted space of their once-thriving home to uncover past secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a cooperative journey, finding joy in overcoming challenges together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your spaceship as a mobile home, collecting items and achievements along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a heartwarming and captivating storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the elusive, flying hearts you strive to capture.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game controls are relatively simple and finely tuned, using just a few basic buttons to maneuver the characters. Level elements enhance the experience, offering a unique sense of excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can clearly see the path through each level, but good coordination and occasional observation of each other\u2019s actions are essential for success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and enjoy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy it, especially if you're a fan of platformer\u2014this is a must-try!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552440?t=1772689940","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552440/523501734c7bdf156d6891c02cf9621023426389/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772689940","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552440/3f0e97d446933481921aba5dfa1ab8492be39375/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772689940","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552440/3f0e97d446933481921aba5dfa1ab8492be39375/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772689940","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552440/extras/7815667b4f5b10384515050060d4cf28.apng?t=1772689940\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552440/extras/7815667b4f5b10384515050060d4cf28.poster.avif?t=1772689940\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=71 /></picture></span><strong>\u300aTwo: Solar Home\u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0is a local co-op platformer game for <i>two players</i>, featuring impressive <i>pixel art</i> and handcrafted levels. Players take on the roles of a brother and sister exploring the collapsed solar system and the silent, deserted space of their once-thriving home to uncover past secrets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a cooperative journey, finding joy in overcoming challenges together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your spaceship as a mobile home, collecting items and achievements along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a heartwarming and captivating storyline.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the elusive, flying hearts you strive to capture.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game controls are relatively simple and finely tuned, using just a few basic buttons to maneuver the characters. Level elements enhance the experience, offering a unique sense of excitement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can clearly see the path through each level, but good coordination and occasional observation of each other\u2019s actions are essential for success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and enjoy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy it, especially if you're a fan of platformer\u2014this is a must-try!</p>","developers":["Team Mingo"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552440/76b7947720b61f70e34cb4359411450ac74ef377/header.jpg?t=1772689940","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3552440/857899/172ca486861a9083d784e8de2536639c1cab30ad/1750840165/dash_av1.mpd?t=1742967578","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3552440/857899/172ca486861a9083d784e8de2536639c1cab30ad/1750840165/dash_h264.mpd?t=1742967578","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3552440/857899/172ca486861a9083d784e8de2536639c1cab30ad/1750840165/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1742967578","id":257118616,"name":"Trailer","thu